  <div class="case-takeaway">
    <h3>Key takeaways</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <div class="tone-junior">An agent that decides and executes in the same step turns every mistake in its plan into a mistake in production, instantly.</div>
        <div class="tone-mid">Separate proposing an action from executing it — show the real parameters, require an explicit approval click before anything runs.</div>
        <div class="tone-staff">Reserve the gate for genuinely high-blast-radius actions, gating everything trains reviewers to rubber-stamp instead of actually reading.</div>
